%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36722238b0204cf0aa52ed6f487fcf02, type: 3}
  m_Name: Narrative_Mall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueSnippets:
  - SpeakerName: Narrator
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: '"Young Mina and her friend are eating while talking"'
  - SpeakerName: Mina's Friend
    HasSpeakerSprite: 0
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: HAHAHAH. Ok, ok - Then what about if we both enter the art club
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: ' Art club?  And then what we end up selling art while sitting at the side
      road of a random European country '
  - SpeakerName: Narrator
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: '"Young mina has a smirk, looking down at her food while her friend''s
      face shifts to stoic and poker face "'
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: 'I dont rember it that way at all. I thought she was joking '
  - SpeakerName: Young Mna
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: 'Why would a kid joke about having big dreams '
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: 'She didnt realize what was lying ahead of her. '
  - SpeakerName: Young Mna
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: 'Wrong, she was a kid, her job was to have fun, not think about the political
      and economic state of the world '
